<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-AUSTRALIA TELECOMS-Telecom NZ reviews Australia bridgehead.</title>
<headline>RTRS-AUSTRALIA TELECOMS-Telecom NZ reviews Australia bridgehead.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd has confirmed it is continuing to review whether it should sell its Australian bridgehead, Pacific Star Group.</p>
<p>&quot;Pacific Star has been a bridge-head for us...but now it's under review, which is a natural evolution over three years,&quot; Telecom Chairman Peter Shirtcliffe told Reuters in a recent interview.</p>
<p>Telecom NZ has previously said it may sell some or all of Pacific Star.</p>
</text>
